  m_text: "<color=#ffe07a>Di chuy\u1EC3n</color>\n  Gi\u1EEF chu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i / ph\u1EA3i, ho\u1EB7c ph\xEDm m\u0169i t\xEAn\n\n<color=#ffe07a>T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng</color>\n  Nh\u1EA5p v\xE0o qu\xE1i v\u1EADt \xB7 Q: Ch\xE9m Gi\xF3\n\n<color=#ffe07a>K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng</color>\n  W C\u1EA7u L\u1EEDa \xB7 E M\u0169i B\u0103ng \xB7 R L\xF4i Ph\u1EA1t\n  A H\u1ED3i Ph\u1EE5c \xB7 S Khi\xEAn Th\xE1nh \xB7 D B\xE3o Ki\u1EBFm\n  Space: L\u01B0\u1EDBt (b\u1EA5t t\u1EED trong ch\u1ED1c l\xE1t)\n\n<color=#ffe07a>B\xECnh thu\u1ED1c</color>\n  1 M\xE1u \xB7 2 N\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng \xB7 3 Th\u1EA3o m\u1ED9c"
